{"availability":"available","full":"Rime504/atlas-rail","name":"atlas-rail","description":"Open-source policy and evidence layer for AI agent payments on Solana: signed mandates, a policy gate, human approval and verifiable receipts. Devnet only. Atlas Rail is the authorization layer for agent payments: delegated financial authority you can prove.","category":"Finance","language":"TypeScript","stars":2,"forks":1,"created":"2026-09-07T10:14:26Z","updated":"2026-10-11T08:48:25Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"master","homepage":"https://atlas-rail-site.vercel.app","topics":["ai-agents","open-source","payments","solana","stablecoins","typescript","x402"],"demo":"https://atlas-rail-playground.vercel.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-13T07:36:45.947Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-13T07:36:45.947Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-13T07:36:45.947Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T23:43:17.443Z","stars":2,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-09T22:06:55.874Z","stars":2,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-13T07:36:45.947Z","stars":2,"forks":1}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["The authorization layer for AI agent payments on Solana. An open standard for delegated spending authority, a gate any agent or wallet can plug in, and proof anyone can check."],"features":["Fast enough to sit in the payment path. Measured on devnet: a gate decision takes p50 351 ms, p95 1,613 ms including a full transaction simulation; payment confirmation p50 1,646 ms (report).","Cheap enough to anchor every batch. One anchorroot costs 10,822 compute units and a 5,000-lamport fee (report).","Money, rules and proof in one place. The token transfer, the mandate account, the anchored receipt root and the memo pointing at the receipt are all readable from the same chain with one RPC endpoint.","Native primitives do the work. TransferChecked, the Memo program and program-derived accounts. No bridge, no oracle, no extra chain."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Rime50